Z||000057||jimmybpei||11-30-2001||07:52 AM||||Nashco why don't you post a new topic covering what has already been discussed.Maybe this will spark some i intrest again when people see a different topic name covering the same thread.<P>Just might work<BR>Later <BR>Jimmy B.||||reg||1
Z||000058||lowCG||11-30-2001||07:49 PM||||GTMike,there's a company called Simple Digital Systems that makes a two injector add on setup that's able to support an additional 160hp in a boosted motor.<BR>The control unit has it's own MAP sensor for determining boost and a processor to figure out the values.There are two control knobs,one for the timing of the enrichment,and another for the amount of enrichment.<BR>The two injectors are mounted upstream of the throttle body,or just after the intercooler.||||reg||1
